====== Neufbox4 (NB4) ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

Neufbox 4 is a Internet box, sold by the french ISP [[wp>Neuf_Telecom]] (later bought by the ISP [[wp>SFR]], 2008).


There was a community website entirely devoted to this device, in French ([[http://www.neufbox4.org|www.neufbox4.org]]) ; it had useful, although sometimes outdated, information, and an active forum. Most info was taken from there. The original website seems not available anymore.

